      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a really interesting way to frame it—focusing on the \"us vs them\" aspect. \n\none more thing, i need to make sure my paper isn't one-sided. could you provide a paragraph that compares the protagonist's approach to policy with the opposition's approach? i want to show the contrast between the two groups to round out the essay.",
